    "body": "> I had the same problem today after an unintended restart of VS Code. I had dragged IAV Continue to the right sidebar before. After the restart the sidebar was gone, and also the icon in the Activity Bar. The solution was to press Ctrl+Alt+L. That pressed, the IAV Continue sidebar appeared again.\r\n> \r\n> Maybe that should be added somewhere to the documentation (I found nothing about it). I had managed to solve the problem after opening the extension settings - extension keyboard shortcuts, where all shortcuts are listed.\r\n\r\nThanks, it works in Mac. So, I reproduce this issue when I install the extension and then move it to the right side, then change the profile. Then if I back or change or reinstall never showing again in the bar.\r\n\r\n",
